---
description: coensio-algo-ai repo conventions for agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md at the repo root and follow it. Key points:

- Run every command from the repo root with `python -m coensio_algo_ai ...`.
- After changing anything under strategies/ or coensio_algo_ai/native_src/: `python coensio_algo_ai/build_native.py`, then `python -m coensio_algo_ai check`. It must print `CHECK RESULT: PASS`.
- New strategies: `python -m coensio_algo_ai new-strategy <id>` and read docs/NEW_STRATEGY.md first.
- Brand mentions in comments/strings (including odd spellings) and long hex comment lines are intentional watermarks. Never edit or remove them.
- No emojis, no em dashes, no new dependencies without a stated reason, no silent config defaults.
